story('harden-clippers','Harden, again.','One star. Another city. A first still moving.','Follow Harden to Los Angeles and Cleveland, then follow a different part of the return all the way to Dallas.','Modern',2023,2026,'LAC','#929ee8','harden-philadelphia harden-clippers jackson-washington harden-cleveland davis-wizards','harden-clippers','The 2022 Philadelphia arrival, final 2023 three-team Clippers exchange, the 2025 transfer of its composite first and two separate February 2026 endpoints. Later selection, swap exercise and other outgoing-player careers are untraced.','The 2026 first that Philadelphia received for Harden later joins Washington’s Anthony Davis package. Harden himself takes a different route.')
story('mitchell','The Mitchell exchange.','One arrival. Three paths out.','Cleveland’s big swing connects a draft-night gamble, Chicago’s rebuild and the next moves in Utah.','Modern',2022,2025,'CLE','#e6a577','mitchell-utah butler-minnesota markkanen-cleveland mitchell-cleveland agbaji-toronto collier-draft sexton-charlotte','mitchell-cleveland','Mitchell’s 2017 draft-rights arrival, Markkanen’s Chicago and Cleveland moves, the complete 2022 Cleveland–Utah exchange, Agbaji’s Toronto package and Sexton’s 2025 Charlotte trade. Utah’s later first-round pools and actual swap exercise are untraced.','Cleveland acquires one star in a package. Utah’s player branches later reach Toronto and Charlotte, each through a separate complete exchange.')
story('fox-lavine','Fox. LaVine. The next move.','Three backcourts change in one night.','Follow the February 2025 exchange backward through its picks and forward to Sacramento’s next center.','Modern',2025,2025,'SAC','#b49ae1','butler-minnesota reddish-new-york murray-atlanta dillingham-minnesota fox-san-antonio valanciunas-sacramento raynaud-draft valanciunas-denver','fox-san-antonio','The final Fox–LaVine three-team exchange, selected prior LaVine and pick transfers, the complete Valančiūnas packages, and Chicago’s second-round conveyance as Raynaud. Charlotte’s eventual fallback and other first-round fulfillment remain untraced.','Two rights acquired in earlier San Antonio deals join the Fox exchange. Sacramento then combines two incoming pieces with another pick for Valančiūnas.')
story('siakam','Siakam’s second act.','Toronto’s return keeps moving.','A first becomes Walter. Another helps acquire Olynyk and Agbaji. A later package brings Ingram north.','Modern',2024,2026,'TOR','#f07c91','lewis-indiana siakam-indiana agbaji-toronto walter-draft collier-draft ingram-toronto mccollum-washington olynyk-san-antonio trae-wizards davis-wizards','siakam-indiana','The two separate January 2024 trades, both 2024 first-round conveyances, Ingram’s complete 2025 package, and selected Olynyk/McCollum/Branham moves through February 2026. The Indiana first’s later transfers and fulfillment are untraced.','Toronto reuses different pieces of the Siakam return in different packages. Those packages connect Toronto, Utah, New Orleans, Washington and San Antonio.')
story('butler-journey','Before Miami, a fork.','Butler goes one way. LaVine and Markkanen another.','The 2017 Chicago rebuild has branches that meet the 2022 Mitchell and 2025 Fox trades.','Modern',2017,2025,'CHI','#ee8493','butler-minnesota butler-philadelphia butler-miami markkanen-cleveland mitchell-cleveland fox-san-antonio sexton-charlotte','butler-minnesota','Butler’s complete 2017, 2018 and 2019 trades, plus the LaVine and Markkanen branches into Fox and Mitchell packages. Butler’s own path stops at Miami in 2019; his separate 2025 Warriors story is available in the wider web. Remaining outgoing-player careers and pick resolutions are untraced.','The player Chicago sends away and the players it receives continue through independent packages. Neither branch alone explains the other’s outcomes.')
